Changelog: 12-11-2026 14:51:59

Release 0.2.0.

Changelog: 12-11-2026 13:24:26

Added. Escape closes the window, as its close button does, and so does B on a controller (owner, 12-11-2026: inside
the apps the B button and the Escape key exit the app, as they exit the portal): an open menu first, then a question
or a dialog, then the window. A key the window takes for itself comes first, and a window that is busy still asks
before it closes. B is read with pygame-ce from the suite's venv, only while the app has the focus and has had it for
half a second, so the press that closed another app does not close this one too; without pygame-ce or a controller
there is Escape alone. __main__ calls core's exit_keys's install().

Changelog: 12-11-2026 11:38:58

Release 0.1.1.

Changelog: 12-11-2026 11:02:25

Fixed. The app has the Utilities category's new icon (owner, 12-11-2026): the blue circuit board, redrawn; its window,
its menu entry and Desktop icon, and the portal's tile show it.

Changelog: 12-11-2026 09:37:25

Release 0.1.0.

Changelog: 12-11-2026 00:14:40

Added. BC-250 Bluetooth Pairing: the first version (owner, 12-11-2026), from the owner's own bt-autopair and
bt-battery scripts. After every boot a system service searches for 5 minutes for the listed devices and pairs, trusts
and connects the ones in pairing mode, on the login screen; one that refuses its old pairing twice is paired again,
and other names are never paired. A second service shows PlayStation controller batteries in the Bluetooth icon. The
window lists the devices (picked from those Bluetooth knows, found in a search, or typed), installs the services
with your password (pkexec), searches again without a reboot, shows what the search after this boot did, and sets
Plasma to switch Bluetooth on at every login: by default Plasma restores the state saved when the last session
ended, which a reboot from a terminal saves as off.
